; Save the CoJag EEPROM score block and its two initialized RAM tables.
; The EEPROM share padding lanes at 0x474 and 0x4C6 are stable zero sentinels.
area51:
; Restore as soon as the game's stable table markers are ready, before its first score-list pass.
@delay=0.1
@:maincpu,:nvram/share,474,53,00,00
@:maincpu,:mainram/share,2B0,5A,01,00
@:maincpu,:mainram/share,30A,5A,00,00
